OUTPUT *.INIT* 1* 

GETVAL wfsIndexed
OUTPUT *.INDX* 1* 

GETVAL wfsParked
OUTPUT *.PARK* 0* 

GETVAL wfsHealth
OUTPUT *.HLTH* GOOD* 

